{
 "\"Joltin Joe\" was considered one of the game's most graceful athletes.  He had a lifetime batting averge of .325, and once held a 56 game hitting streak.": "\"졸팅 조\"는 가장 우아한 선수로 꼽혔습니다. 통산 타율 .325, 56경기 연속 안타 기록을 세웠습니다.",
 "\"Maz\" was one of the best defensive second basemen, with a lifetime .983 fielding percentage.": "\"매즈\"는 최고의 수비형 2루수로, 통산 수비율 .983을 기록했습니다.",
 "1949.  Was solid at 3rd and was considered the best of his time at the position.": "1949년. 3루 수비가 탄탄해 당대 최고의 3루수로 꼽혔습니다.",
 "A dead-pull hitter who always looked for the inside pitch, Hodges was a model of consistency.  Very strong and a great arm.": "몸쪽 공을 노리는 당겨치기 타자 호지스는 꾸준함의 표본이었습니다. 힘이 세고 어깨도 좋았습니다.",
 "A dominating pitcher, he had pinpoint control and a tight curve.  He was smart and tough and could pitch in any situation.": "정교한 제구와 날카로운 커브를 지닌 압도적 투수. 영리하고 강인해 어떤 상황에도 등판했습니다.",
 "A great hitter who led the AL in batting in 1949.  Was solid at 3rd and was considered the best of his time at the position.": "1949년 AL 타격왕에 오른 강타자. 3루 수비가 탄탄해 당대 최고의 3루수로 꼽혔습니다.",
 "A huge superstar of his day; considered the best player ever. He smacked 714 HRs in his career and was also a great pitcher.": "당대 최고 슈퍼스타이자 역대 최고 선수. 통산 714홈런을 쳤고 뛰어난 투수이기도 했습니다.",
 "A lefthanded power hitter, who was smooth and consistent in the field.  Feasted on FBs and could line the ball anywhere in the park.": "부드럽고 꾸준한 수비의 좌타 거포. 직구에 강했고 구장 어디로든 라인드라이브를 날렸습니다.",
 "A natural athlete blessed with tremendous power, a strong arm, and durability.  He was the best third baseman of his era.": "엄청난 파워, 강한 어깨, 내구성을 갖춘 타고난 운동선수. 당대 최고의 3루수였습니다.",
 "A powerful switch-hitter, Murray is one of only three players to collect over 3,000 hits and 500 home runs during his career.": "강력한 스위치 타자 머리는 통산 3,000안타와 500홈런을 달성한 단 3명 중 하나입니다.",
 "A top center fielder who was a star at the plate as well.  He smacked 253 HRs in his career.": "타석에서도 빛난 정상급 중견수. 통산 253홈런을 기록했습니다.",
 "Alexander won 373 games with a live fastball and a sharp curve. He had great control and could change speeds with the best of them.": "알렉산더는 힘있는 직구와 예리한 커브로 373승을 거뒀습니다. 제구와 완급 조절이 탁월했습니다.",
 "All-time leader in wins with 511 games. Young threw very hard and got the nickname Cyclone 'Cy' because of it.": "통산 511승의 역대 최다승 투수. 공이 매우 빨라 사이클론, 즉 '사이'라는 별명을 얻었습니다.",
 "Aparicio was a slick fielding shortstop who was amazing in the field.  He was a good spray-hitter with exceptional speed.": "아파리시오는 놀라운 수비를 보여준 유격수. 밀어치기에 능하고 발이 매우 빨랐습니다.",
 "Ashburn, the ultimate slap hitter who knew how to get on base.  He was a model of consistency with a .308 lifetime average.": "출루의 달인인 슬랩 히터 애시번. 통산 타율 .308로 꾸준함의 표본이었습니다.",
 "Bench was one of the leaders of the \"Big Red Machine.\"  He was also an outstanding hitter, belting out 389 home runs during his career.": "벤치는 \"빅 레드 머신\"의 리더 중 한 명. 타격도 뛰어나 통산 389홈런을 쳤습니다.",
 "Berra was a very popular player who was a master at calling pitches and handling a pitching staff.  Also known for Yogi-isms.": "베라는 볼 배합과 투수 리드에 능한 인기 선수였습니다. 요기 어록으로도 유명합니다.",
 "Blessed with a strong, durable physique and determined personality.  Ferrell was a fine all-around catcher.": "튼튼한 체격과 굳센 성격을 타고났습니다. 페럴은 공수에 뛰어난 포수였습니다.",
 "Boudreau was a slick fielder and a steady hitter.  Was a solid batter who really could turn the double play.": "부드로는 수비가 매끄럽고 타격이 꾸준했습니다. 병살 처리에 특히 능했습니다.",
 "Brock was both a tremendous base stealer and a clutch hitter.  He retired with 938 career stolen bases, and 3,023 career hits.": "브록은 뛰어난 도루왕이자 해결사였습니다. 통산 938도루, 3,023안타로 은퇴했습니다.",
 "Bunning had an unusual pitching style, with a sweeping sidearm delivery that made it very hard on righthanded batters.  He won 224 games.": "버닝은 휘두르는 사이드암 투구로 우타자를 괴롭힌 독특한 투수였습니다. 통산 224승을 거뒀습니다.",
 "Carlton \"Pudge\" Fisk was the definition of a workhorse behind the plate, catching 2,226 games.  He was also an 11-time All-Star.": "칼튼 \"퍼지\" 피스크는 2,226경기에 출전한 철인 포수였습니다. 올스타에도 11회 뽑혔습니다.",
 "Cepeda was nicknamed \"The Baby Bull\" and had a great career as a power hitter.  He smacked in 379 HRs in his career.": "세페다는 \"베이비 불\"이라 불린 거포였습니다. 통산 379홈런을 기록했습니다.",
 "Cobb has the highest career batting average in history at .367.  Was a fierce competitor with a keen eye at the plate.": "콥은 통산 타율 .367로 역대 1위입니다. 투지가 넘치고 선구안이 날카로웠습니다.",
 "Collins was one of the most accomplished players to play the game.  He was a great bunter and a slashing hitter.": "콜린스는 가장 뛰어난 선수 중 하나였습니다. 번트에 능하고 날카로운 타자였습니다.",
 "Considered baseball's greatest righthanded hitter.  He could hit any ball pitched to him and had a .358 career batting average.": "야구 역사상 최고의 우타자. 어떤 공도 쳐냈으며 통산 타율 .358을 기록했습니다.",
 "Dean was a bold and zany pitcher who threw blazing fastballs and sharp curves. He loved to challenge any hitter in the game.": "딘은 불같은 직구와 예리한 커브를 던진 대담하고 괴짜인 투수. 어떤 타자와도 승부를 즐겼습니다.",
 "Doerr was a solid second baseman who stepped up his play in the big games.  A real clutch player.": "도어는 큰 경기에서 더 빛난 탄탄한 2루수였습니다. 진정한 해결사였습니다.",
 "Dominating pitcher with outstanding control and a nasty fade away pitch to fool hitters. Great mechanics helped him win 373 games.": "뛰어난 제구와 까다로운 페이드어웨이로 타자를 속인 투수. 좋은 투구폼으로 373승을 거뒀습니다.",
 "Drysdale combined an explosive fastball with great control to become one of baseball's premier power pitchers.": "드라이스데일은 폭발적인 직구와 제구력을 겸비한 최고의 파워 투수였습니다.",
 "Eckersley was a dominating force on the mound, with a dangerously deceptive sidearm delivery.  He's the only pitcher to have 100 saves and 100 complete games.": "에커슬리는 속기 쉬운 사이드암 투구로 마운드를 지배했습니다. 100세이브와 100완투를 모두 기록한 유일한 투수입니다.",
 "Feller was considered the hardest thrower of his time, but his curve and slider were just as deadly.  He had an amazing arm.": "펠러는 당대 가장 빠른 공을 던졌고 커브와 슬라이더도 위력적이었습니다. 놀라운 어깨였습니다.",
 "Fingers was famous for his handlebar mustache.  Retired as the greatest reliever of his time, with 341 career saves.": "핑거스는 핸들바 콧수염으로 유명했습니다. 통산 341세이브, 당대 최고 마무리로 은퇴했습니다.",
 "Foxx, known as one of the greatest power hitters in baseball, crushed 534 homers in his career. He was menacing at the plate.": "최고의 거포 중 하나인 폭스는 통산 534홈런을 쳤습니다. 타석에서 위협적이었습니다.",
 "Gehrig: the greatest 1st baseman to play the game.  Very dependable as shown by his consecutive games played streak of 2,130.": "게릭은 역대 최고의 1루수. 2,130경기 연속 출장 기록이 보여주듯 매우 믿음직했습니다.",
 "Gibson was known for being one of the most intimidating and dominating pitchers. He had great stamina and pinpoint control.": "깁슨은 가장 위압적이고 압도적인 투수 중 하나. 체력이 좋고 제구가 정교했습니다.",
 "Grove won 300 games with a hot fastball and temper.  He could really pitch, leading the American League in ERA 9 times.": "그로브는 강속구와 불같은 성격으로 300승을 거뒀습니다. AL 평균자책점 1위를 9번 했습니다.",
 "He had a tremendous fastball and was intimidating on the mound.": "강속구를 던졌고 마운드에서 위압적이었습니다.",
 "Hunter won 21 or more games 5 straight times, and won the AL Cy Young Award in 1974. He handled the pressure of big games better than anyone in the bigs.": "헌터는 5년 연속 21승 이상을 올렸고 1974년 AL 사이 영 상을 받았습니다. 큰 경기 압박에 누구보다 강했습니다.",
 "Irvin could run, throw, field, hit, and hit with power, all brilliantly.  A star player during his time.": "어빈은 주루, 송구, 수비, 타격, 장타 모두 뛰어났습니다. 당대의 스타였습니다.",
 "Jenkins was a hard throwing righthander. He won 284 games in his career but never won a pennant.": "젠킨스는 강속구 우완 투수. 통산 284승을 거뒀지만 리그 우승은 못했습니다.",
 "Johnson won 417 games with a blazing FB, considered near invisible for hitters.  He dominated every pitching category.": "존슨은 보이지 않을 정도의 강속구로 417승을 거뒀습니다. 모든 투구 부문을 지배했습니다.",
 "Kaline's skills were well honed:  hitting for power and average, speed, throwing, and fielding judgement.  He was Mr. Tiger!": "케일라인은 장타, 정확성, 주루, 송구, 수비 판단 모두 뛰어났습니다. 그는 미스터 타이거!",
 "Killebrew, an 11-time All-Star, was a pure power hitter.  He hit an impressive 573 home runs during his 22 major league seasons.": "11회 올스타 킬러브루는 순수한 거포였습니다. 22시즌 동안 573홈런을 쳤습니다.",
 "Kiner was the greatest home run hitter after WWII.  He lacked speed, but was sure-handed in the field and had an accurate arm.": "카이너는 2차대전 후 최고의 홈런 타자. 발은 느렸지만 수비가 안정되고 송구가 정확했습니다.",
 "Known for both his outstanding defensive flair and his tremendous power, Sandberg was a 9-time Gold Glove winner.  He also won the NL MVP award in 1984.": "화려한 수비와 엄청난 파워로 유명한 샌버그는 골드 글러브 9회 수상자. 1984년 NL MVP도 받았습니다.",
 "Lemon threw hard and his sinking FB was his out pitch.  A leader and popular player. He was considered a great hitting pitcher.": "레몬은 강속구를 던졌고 싱킹 직구가 결정구였습니다. 인기 리더이자 타격 좋은 투수였습니다.",
 "Lopez was not much of an offensive threat, but was an extremely durable catcher.": "로페스는 공격력은 약했지만 매우 튼튼한 포수였습니다.",
 "Machine.\"  He was also an outstanding hitter, belting out 389 home runs during his career.": "머신\"의 일원. 타격도 뛰어나 통산 389홈런을 쳤습니다.",
 "Marichal was known for having a high kicking delivery.  He won 243 games and struck out 2,303 hitters during his career.": "마리샬은 다리를 높이 차는 투구폼으로 유명했습니다. 통산 243승, 2,303탈삼진을 기록했습니다.",
 "McCovey was a devastating dead-pull power hitter and one of the most feared home run hitters of his time, crushing 521.": "매코비는 파괴적인 당겨치기 거포이자 당대 가장 두려운 홈런 타자. 521홈런을 쳤습니다.",
 "Morgan was a rare commodity, a speedy second baseman with power.  He was a spark plug who ignited his team all the time.": "모건은 파워를 갖춘 빠른 2루수라는 보기 드문 존재. 늘 팀에 불을 붙였습니다.",
 "Munson was a tremendous defensive catcher, and had arguably the fastest release in baseball.  Named the AL Rookie of the Year in 1970 and a 7-time All-Star.": "먼슨은 뛰어난 수비형 포수로 송구가 리그에서 가장 빨랐습니다. 1970년 AL 신인왕, 올스타 7회.",
 "Niekro was a great knuckleball pitcher who had longevity, durability, and unpredictability as a pitcher.": "니크로는 너클볼 투수로 장수, 내구성, 예측 불가함을 갖췄습니다.",
 "One of his era's most outstanding players. Was a great leader as a catcher and was well liked by the players.": "당대 가장 뛰어난 선수 중 하나. 포수로서 리더십이 좋아 선수들에게 사랑받았습니다.",
 "One of the game's top relievers, Sutter was a master of the split-finger  fastball.  He won the NL Cy Young Award in 1979, and was a 6-time all-star.": "최고의 마무리 중 하나인 서터는 스플리터의 달인. 1979년 NL 사이 영 상 수상, 올스타 6회.",
 "One of the greatest catchers of all time.  An intense competitor who owns the highest career batting average for catchers at .320.": "역대 최고 포수 중 하나. 강한 승부욕을 지녔고 포수 최고 통산 타율 .320을 보유했습니다.",
 "Ott was a solid right fielder who was very patient at the plate.  First NL player to hit 500 HRs.  Could hit any ball pitched to him.": "오트는 인내심 강한 우익수. NL 최초로 500홈런을 쳤습니다. 어떤 공이든 쳐냈습니다.",
 "Paige displayed incredible athletic ability, tremendous durability and great sportsmanship.  A star with a smoking FB.": "페이지는 놀라운 운동 능력, 내구성, 스포츠맨십을 보였습니다. 불같은 직구의 스타.",
 "Palmer was one of the most dependable pitchers in baseball.  Had a picture-perfect delivery and all-around great athleticism.": "파머는 가장 믿음직한 투수 중 하나. 완벽한 투구폼과 뛰어난 운동 능력을 갖췄습니다.",
 "Perez was a clutch hitter for Cincinnati's \"Big Red Machine.\"  He recorded 1,652 RBI's during his 23 major league seasons.": "페레스는 신시내티 \"빅 레드 머신\"의 해결사. 23시즌 동안 1,652타점을 기록했습니다.",
 "Perry was the first pitcher to win the Cy Young Award in both leagues.  He won 314 games in his career by frustrating hitters.": "페리는 양 리그에서 사이 영 상을 받은 첫 투수. 타자를 괴롭히며 통산 314승을 거뒀습니다.",
 "Red Machine.\"  He recorded 1,652 RBI's during his 23 major league seasons.": "레드 머신\"의 일원. 23시즌 동안 1,652타점을 기록했습니다.",
 "Red was one of the best switch hitters of his day.  He had sure hands and quick reflexes.": "레드는 당대 최고의 스위치 타자 중 하나. 손이 안정되고 반사 신경이 빨랐습니다.",
 "Reese was a smooth fielder who became one of the top shortstops of his era.  A great leadoff hitter, who was well liked.": "리스는 매끄러운 수비로 당대 정상급 유격수가 됐습니다. 사랑받은 훌륭한 1번 타자.",
 "Reggie Jackson earned the nickname \"Mr. October,\" for his unprecendented 10 home runs, 24 RBI, and .357 batting average in the post season.": "레지 잭슨은 포스트시즌 10홈런, 24타점, 타율 .357을 기록해 \"미스터 옥토버\"로 불렸습니다.",
 "Rizzuto was a fair hitter and great bunter. Solid in the field, he was considered one of the best shortstops of his time.": "리주토는 무난한 타자이자 번트의 달인. 수비가 탄탄해 당대 최고 유격수로 꼽혔습니다.",
 "Roberts was a hard-nosed competitor who in his prime was tough to beat.  He won 286 games during his 19 year career.": "로버츠는 전성기에 꺾기 힘든 강인한 투수였습니다. 19년 동안 286승을 거뒀습니다.",
 "Robinson played third base with style, class, and an uncanny ability to turn in spectacular plays with startling regularity.": "로빈슨은 품격 있는 3루 수비로 놀라운 플레이를 꾸준히 보여줬습니다.",
 "Ryan is baseball's all-time strikeout leader and owner of an MLB record 7 no-hitters.  One of the most amazing pitchers ever to play the game.": "라이언은 역대 탈삼진 1위이자 MLB 기록인 노히터 7회 보유자. 가장 놀라운 투수 중 하나입니다.",
 "Schmidt is considered the best all-around third baseman of all time.  He crushed 548 home runs in his career.": "슈미트는 역대 최고의 3루수로 꼽힙니다. 통산 548홈런을 쳤습니다.",
 "Seaver was a true power pitcher with a 2.86 lifetime ERA and 3,640 career strikeouts.  He once struck out 19 in a single game.": "시버는 통산 평균자책점 2.86, 3,640탈삼진의 정통 파워 투수. 한 경기 19탈삼진도 했습니다.",
 "Slaughter, a lefty who hit .300 or better ten times, a superb outfielder with a deadly accurate arm.  The quintessential hustler.": "좌타자 슬로터는 3할 이상을 10번 친 뛰어난 외야수로 송구가 정확했습니다. 허슬의 상징.",
 "Solid in the field, he was considered one of the best shortstops of his time.": "수비가 탄탄해 당대 최고의 유격수로 꼽혔습니다.",
 "Speaker, one of the greatest centerfielders of all time.  Had great speed and a powerful stroke.  Carried a career average of .345.": "스피커는 역대 최고의 중견수 중 하나. 발이 빠르고 타격이 강했습니다. 통산 타율 .345.",
 "Stargell with a swing of the bat could send a ball flying out of the park.  A menacing figure and club leader who crushed 475 HRs.": "스타젤은 한 방에 공을 장외로 날렸습니다. 위협적인 팀의 리더로 475홈런을 쳤습니다.",
